  "prefLabel": "Puc 205.02 Manner for Adoption",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 205.02 Manner for Adoption.\n\n(a) The commission shall commence a rulemaking proceeding by drafting a proposed rule or by accepting as a proposed rule the draft of a rule proposed by any person or governmental agency.\n\n(b) With respect to any proposed rule, the commission shall conduct rulemaking adoption proceedings which the chairman will oversee and preside over pursuant to RSA 541-A.\n\nSource. #8657-A, eff 6-10-06; ss by #14184, eff 1-24-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc200.html"
}
